<title>UK: Pirelli sets 120 mln Sfr three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Pirelli sets 120 mln Sfr three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PIRELLI</p>
<p> AMT    120 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    09.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	EOS	   28.NOV.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
